==Icelandic==
{{Icelandic declension kvk sb 01|klukkustund}}

===Etymology===
From {{gen}} of ''[[klukka]]'' meaning "[[clock]]" (from {{etyl|la|is}} ''[[clocca]]'') and ''[[stund]]'' meaning "[[hour]]". Literally meaning "hour of a clock" or "clock's hour".

===Noun===
'''klukkustund''' {{f}}

# [[hour]]

====Synonyms====
* [[klukkutími]]
* [[tími]] (''colloquial short form'')

